# Keep the repo succinct

- Root **README** = human play + release steps.
- **AGENTS.md** = agent index.
- Per-base history = `bases/*/CHANGELOG.md` only.
- Do not add extra instruction sprawl, builder READMEs, or duplicate release guides.
- Prefer editing an existing doc over creating a new one.
- Never commit game binaries.

## Discord posts in `docs/INSTRUCTIONS.md`

- **Succinct:** a few short lines for Discord paste
- What shipped + one concrete detail if needed
- Builder link on its own line: https://individualcontributor.dev/builder/
- No long explanations, tables, commit hashes, or stack dumps
- Latest post under **Discord post (copy-paste)**; overwrite old drafts
